      "post" : {
        "description" : "Start Combine: a local proxy on 127.0.0.1:7591 spreads new connections across every link with internet (Wi-Fi, iPhone USB, Ethernet) and, with systemProxy, points macOS's auto-proxy at it. A single download stays on one link; many connections add up.",
